  - version: 3.5.4
    date: '2025-12-03'
    changes:
    - Registered 6 migrated orchestrators from Sprint 13b completion
    - Added ado_work_item operation (ADO work item management)
    - Added swagger_estimation operation (SWAGGER/OpenAPI complexity analysis)
    - Added ux_enhancement operation (UX improvement analysis)
    - Added lint_validation operation (code linting and validation)
    - Added application_health operation (health dashboard and monitoring)
    - Added rca operation (root cause analysis with 5 Whys)
    - All 6 operations are user-facing and deployment_tier user
    - Orchestrator migration program 97% complete (29/30 orchestrators migrated)
  - version: '3.0'
    date: '2025-11-23'
    changes:
    - Added Feedback & Analytics System (feedback_report and admin_feedback_review
      operations)
    - Added enhanced_feedback_module with 8-category metrics collection
    - Added admin_feedback_review_module for aggregation and analytics
    - Added 2 new feedback operations (1 user-facing, 1 admin-only)
    - Added 2 new feedback modules (1 implemented, 1 pending)
    - Enhanced feedback_triggers in response-templates-v4.yaml
    - GitHub Gist integration with privacy sanitization
  - version: '2.1'
    date: '2025-11-10'
    changes:
    - Fixed module count (added brain_health_check 11 modules)
    - Updated statistics to reflect accurate totals
    - Architecture review identified 8 gaps for future improvement
  - version: '2.1'
    date: '2025-11-10'
    changes:
    - Added Interactive Demo System (cortex_tutorial operation)
    - Added 6 new demo modules for hands-on onboarding
    - Added demo_introduction, demo_help_system, demo_story_refresh modules
    - Added demo_cleanup, demo_conversation, demo_completion modules
    - Total token cost: 700 tokens for complete demo walkthrough
  - version: '2.1'
    date: '2025-11-09'
    changes:
    - Added CORTEX 2.1 interactive planning operations
    - Added CORTEX 2.1 command discovery operations
    - Added 5 new planning-focused operations
    - Added 2 new discovery-focused operations
    - Added 22 new modules for 2.1 features
    - All 2.1 operations marked as 'pending' implementation
  - version: '2.0'
    date: '2025-11-08'
    changes:
    - Initial universal operations architecture
    - Migrated setup operation (4 modules functional)
    - Defined 6 operations with 48 modules total
